    {
      "id": "p0124-b002",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "In his translation notes, ~ Toby emphasized this gameplay hint is meant to sound \"obtuse\". Clarification is at the heart of translation, so I find that translating \"obtuse\" stuff can either be really fun or really nightmarish",
        "raw": "In his translation notes, ~\nToby emphasized this\ngameplay hint is meant\nto sound \"obtuse\".\nClarification is at the\nheart of translation, so\nI find that translating\n\"obtuse\" stuff can either\nbe really fun or really\nnightmarish",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.11283001,
          0.09131429,
          0.28275853,
          0.23810714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.1115038,
          0.0906,
          0.28408474,
          0.23917857
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          2,
          4,
          6,
          8,
          9,
          10,
          12,
          13,
          14,
          15
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Toby 在翻译说明中强调，这条玩法提示应该显得“晦涩”。翻译的核心是把事情说清，所以在我看来，翻译这种“晦涩”内容，要么非常有趣，要么简直是噩梦。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
