        ],
        "font_size": 15.5,
        "leading": 22.474999999999998
      },
      "review_issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0124-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Sans explains that a blue-colored attack in battle won't cause damage if the player remains still. He then suggests a needlessly complicated technique for remembering this fact:",
        "raw": "Sans explains that a blue-colored attack in battle won't cause damage if the\nplayer remains still. He then suggests a needlessly complicated technique for\nremembering this fact:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29350084,
          0.25384286,
          0.88401188,
          0.30202143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29113406,
          0.25312857,
          0.89177532,
          0.30309286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          16,
          17,
          18
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Sans 解释，战斗中的蓝色攻击不会伤害静止不动的玩家。然后，他提供了一个毫无必要地复杂的记忆方法：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
